# Eastern Plaguelands - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# 76 Alliance quests (band 50-60, census docs/eastern-plaguelands-census.md).
# Hub flow: Chillwind Camp (Ashlam/MacDonnell/cauldron chain, Barov, Argent,
# Shadowmore) -> Darrowshire (Marlene/Janice/Dalson farm) -> Andorhal/Chromie
# (temporal chain, catalogue) -> Tirion in the north (redemption chain) ->
# Scholomance east (Eva/Arbington/Marduke) -> Kirsta -> Mulgris, with grouped
# expedition legs for every out-of-zone objective and turn-in. Scholomance and
# Stratholme interiors ride at the Scholomance Door face (69.4,73.2), the same
# face the Western Plaguelands guide uses. Coordinates use the pack era
# qualifier; every goto/complete is written from the local Forever data.
guide butler-routes-completionist/eastern-plaguelands
title Eastern Plaguelands
levels 50-60
zone Eastern Plaguelands
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Eastern Kingdoms
coords live
version 1

